            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gagner de l’<keyword id=\"gold\">Or</keyword> a <value id=\"quantity_1\">%1$lld</value>%% de chances de déclencher la <keyword id=\"cleanse\">Purification</keyword> de <value id=\"quantity_2\">%2$lld</value> malus"
